          "section1Text": "Our responsive support system for your QR menu restaurant or cafe works directly within your dashboard. No need to search for contact emails or wait in phone queues. Simply open the support chat, type your question or describe the change you need, and our team responds quickly. Whether you need help updating menu items, fixing display issues, or understanding analytics - responsive support is just a message away.",
