          "section3Title": "Support That Understands Restaurant Needs",
          "section3Text": "Our responsive support team understands the unique challenges of running a restaurant or cafe. We know that a broken QR menu can mean lost customers and frustrated staff. That's why our support for your QR menu restaurant or cafe prioritizes quick response times and practical solutions. From technical questions to feature requests, we're here to help your digital menu succeed.",
