          "description": "Generate QR menu and restaurant website instantly. Create custom QR codes for your cafe or restaurant in minutes with printable layouts for A4, A5, A6 paper formats. Free instant generator."
        },
        "content": {
          "intro": "IQ Rest now offers an instant QR menu and restaurant website generator that creates professional digital menus in minutes. Whether you run a cozy cafe or a busy restaurant, our instant generator lets you create, customize, and print QR codes that link directly to your digital menu website. No technical skills required, no waiting - just instant QR menu creation for restaurants and cafes of any size.",
