          "section1Title": "How the Instant QR Menu Generator Works",
          "section1Text": "Our instant QR menu and restaurant website generator creates everything you need in minutes. Simply add your menu items, and the system instantly generates a unique QR code linked to your restaurant website. The generator supports multiple paper formats (A4, A5, A6, Letter), various QR layouts per page (1 to 16 codes), and customizable text beneath each QR code. Preview exactly what you'll print, then download or print directly - your instant QR menu is ready to display at your tables.",
          "section2Title": "Customizable QR Codes for Any Restaurant or Cafe",
          "section2Text": "The instant QR menu generator offers complete customization for your restaurant or cafe branding. Add your restaurant name above the QR code, include custom text like 'Scan for Menu' or 'QR Menu' below, and choose from three text sizes. The generator produces clean, simple QR codes optimized for fast scanning. Whether you need a single large QR code for a poster or 16 smaller codes for individual table cards, our instant generator adapts to your restaurant's needs.",
          "section3Title": "Print-Ready QR Menus in Seconds",
          "section3Text": "Unlike complicated design tools, our instant QR menu generator creates print-ready layouts automatically. Select your paper format, choose how many QR codes per page, and hit print - that's it. The generator handles margins, spacing, and sizing to ensure perfect prints every time. For cafes and restaurants that need professional QR menus quickly, this instant approach saves hours of design work and gets your digital menu in front of customers faster.",
          "benefitsTitle": "Benefits of Instant QR Menu Generation",
          "benefit1": "Generate complete QR menu and restaurant website in minutes, not hours",
          "benefit2": "Multiple paper formats: A4, A5, A6, and Letter sizes supported",
          "benefit3": "Flexible layouts: from single large QR to 16 codes per page",
          "benefit4": "Custom text and sizing options for your restaurant branding",
          "benefit5": "Print-ready output with automatic margins and spacing",
          "benefit6": "Download as PNG or print directly from your browser",
          "conclusionTitle": "Start Using the Instant QR Menu Generator",
          "conclusionText": "With IQ Rest's instant QR menu and restaurant website generator, you can have a professional digital menu up and running in minutes. No design skills needed, no expensive software required - just instant generation of beautiful, scannable QR codes that connect customers to your menu. Perfect for new restaurants launching their first QR menu or established cafes updating their existing setup. Generate your instant QR menu today and modernize your dining experience.",
