          "description": "Step-by-step guide on how to add items to restaurant website with QR menu. Add dishes, set prices, upload photos, and organize your digital menu. Easy item management for restaurants."
        },
        "content": {
          "intro": "Want to know how to add items to your restaurant website with QR menu? IQ Rest makes it incredibly easy to add and manage menu items on your digital restaurant website. Whether you're adding your first dish or updating your entire menu, our intuitive item management system helps you create a professional QR menu that showcases your cuisine perfectly. This guide shows you exactly how to add items to restaurant website with QR menu, including photos, prices, descriptions, and categories.",
