        "meta": {
          "title": "Easy QR Menu for Cafe - New Control Panel | IQ Rest",
          "description": "Create QR menu for your cafe easily with our new control panel. Modern sidebar interface for managing categories, products, QR codes, and analytics. Easy cafe menu creation."
        },
        "content": {
          "intro": "We're excited to introduce our brand new admin control panel designed to make creating QR menus for your cafe as easy as possible. Whether you're running a small coffee shop or a bustling cafe, our easy-to-use interface helps you manage your digital menu effortlessly. The new control panel features a modern sidebar design that puts all the tools you need to create your cafe's QR menu right at your fingertips.",
          "image1Alt": "Easy QR menu control panel for cafe management",
          "image1Caption": "New control panel with sidebar navigation for easy cafe QR menu creation",
          "section1Title": "Modern Sidebar Interface for Easy Menu Management",
          "section1Text": "The new control panel features a sleek sidebar that makes navigating your cafe's QR menu settings incredibly easy. With clearly organized sections for Dashboard, Categories, Products, QR Code, Analytics, Settings, Billing, and Support, you can easily find and manage every aspect of your cafe's digital menu. The sidebar collapses on mobile devices, ensuring easy access to all features regardless of what device you're using to manage your cafe's QR menu.",
          "section2Title": "Easy Category and Product Management for Your Cafe",
          "section2Text": "Creating and organizing your cafe's QR menu has never been easier. Our new category and product management pages are designed with simplicity in mind, allowing cafe owners to easily add, edit, and organize their menu items. Whether you're updating daily specials or adding seasonal drinks, the easy-to-use interface ensures your cafe's QR menu stays current and appealing to customers.",
          "section3Title": "Server-Side Rendering for Fast Performance",
          "section3Text": "The new control panel is built with server-side rendering (SSR) technology, ensuring your cafe's QR menu management dashboard loads quickly and efficiently. All data is fetched from the server, providing real-time updates and a smooth experience. This easy and fast approach means you spend less time waiting and more time perfecting your cafe's QR menu.",
          "benefitsTitle": "Why This Makes QR Menu Creation Easy for Cafes",
          "benefit1": "Easy navigation with modern sidebar interface for quick access to all cafe menu features",
          "benefit2": "Easy category management to organize your cafe's QR menu logically",
          "benefit3": "Easy product editing with instant updates to your cafe's digital menu",
          "benefit4": "Easy QR code generation and customization for your cafe",
          "benefit5": "Easy analytics to understand how customers interact with your cafe's QR menu",
          "benefit6": "Easy mobile access - manage your cafe's QR menu from any device",
          "conclusionTitle": "Create Your Cafe's QR Menu the Easy Way",
          "conclusionText": "Our new control panel represents a major step forward in making QR menu creation easy for cafe owners everywhere. With its intuitive sidebar interface, fast server-side rendering, and comprehensive management tools, creating and maintaining your cafe's digital QR menu has never been easier. Join thousands of cafes already using IQ Rest to provide their customers with an easy, modern menu experience.",
          "ctaText": "Ready to create an easy QR menu for your cafe?",
          "ctaButton": "Get Started Free"
        }
      },
      "faq-page-organization": {
        "title": "Get QR Menu for Restaurants - FAQ Page & How-To Guide Updates",
        "description": "Learn how to get QR menu for restaurants with our improved FAQ page and 4-step guide. Discover answers to common questions about getting QR menus for your restaurant, with better navigation and SEO-optimized content.",
        "meta": {
          "title": "Get QR Menu for Restaurants - FAQ & Guide Updates | IQ Rest",
          "description": "Learn how to get QR menu for restaurants easily. New dedicated FAQ page answers all questions about getting QR menus for your restaurant. Streamlined 4-step guide to get started."
        },
        "content": {
          "intro": "We've made it easier than ever to get QR menu for restaurants. Our reorganized FAQ and how-to content helps restaurant owners quickly find answers about how to get QR menus for their establishments. Whether you're looking to get a QR menu for your restaurant or café, this update provides all the information you need in one place.",
          "image1Alt": "How to get QR menu for restaurants - dedicated FAQ page",
          "image1Caption": "New FAQ page showing how to get QR menu for restaurants with organized questions and answers",
          "section1Title": "Dedicated FAQ Page for Getting QR Menus",
          "section1Text": "All questions about how to get QR menu for restaurants are now on a dedicated /faq page. Restaurant owners can easily find answers about getting QR menus, from setup to customization. Each question about getting a QR menu for your restaurant is displayed in its own card with expanded answers, making it simple to get the information you need to get started with QR menus for your restaurant.",
          "section2Title": "4-Step Guide to Get QR Menu for Restaurants",
          "section2Text": "Our streamlined guide shows exactly how to get QR menu for restaurants in just 4 easy steps. Whether you want to get a QR menu for your restaurant, café, or bar, the new card-based design makes it clear how to get started. This guide to get QR menus for restaurants appears on all pages, ensuring you always know how to get your restaurant's QR menu set up quickly.",
          "section3Title": "SEO-Optimized Content to Help Restaurants Get QR Menus",
          "section3Text": "We've optimized our content to help more restaurants discover how to get QR menus. The guide appears with full Schema.org structured data on the homepage, helping restaurants searching for how to get QR menu solutions find us easily. Our smart content distribution ensures restaurants can get the QR menu information they need while maintaining strong search engine visibility.",
          "benefitsTitle": "Why This Helps You Get QR Menu for Your Restaurant",
          "benefit1": "Dedicated FAQ page answers all questions about getting QR menus for restaurants",
          "benefit2": "Clear 4-step guide shows exactly how to get QR menu for your restaurant",
          "benefit3": "Easy access to FAQ and contact options to help you get your QR menu set up",
          "benefit4": "SEO-optimized to help restaurants discover how to get QR menus easily",
          "benefit5": "Consistent information about getting QR menus across the entire platform",
          "benefit6": "Faster path to get QR menu for your restaurant with improved navigation",
          "conclusionTitle": "Get QR Menu for Your Restaurant Today",
          "conclusionText": "These improvements make it incredibly easy for restaurants to get QR menus. Whether you're a small café looking to get a QR menu or a large restaurant chain, our reorganized content helps you understand exactly how to get QR menu solutions for your establishment. Start now and get your restaurant's QR menu up and running in minutes.",
          "ctaText": "Ready to get QR menu for your restaurant?",
          "ctaButton": "Get QR Menu Now"
        }
      },
      "free-restaurant-website-improvements": {
        "title": "Free Restaurant Website Creation - Mobile Optimization & UX Improvements",
        "description": "Major improvements to creating a free restaurant website: optimized mobile navigation with hamburger menu, enhanced signup page for better conversions, and streamlined user experience.",
        "meta": {
          "title": "Free Restaurant Website Creation Updates - IQ Rest Changelog",
          "description": "Learn how IQ Rest improved the free restaurant website creation process with mobile-optimized navigation, better signup flow, and enhanced user experience for cafes and restaurants"
        },
        "content": {
          "intro": "Creating a free restaurant website has never been easier or more mobile-friendly. We've made significant improvements to help restaurant and cafe owners build their professional website with a digital QR menu, especially on mobile devices where most people search for 'создание сайта для ресторана бесплатно' (free restaurant website creation). These updates focus on mobile navigation, signup page refinements, and overall user experience to ensure anyone can create a restaurant website for free without any technical knowledge.",
          "image1Alt": "Mobile-optimized hamburger menu for restaurant website",
          "image1Caption": "New mobile navigation with hamburger menu for easy access to all features",
          "section1Title": "Mobile-First Navigation for Restaurant Websites",
          "section1Text": "Most restaurant owners search for and create their free restaurant website on mobile devices. That's why we've completely redesigned our mobile navigation with a professional hamburger menu. On smartphones and tablets, the navigation now opens as a clean modal dialog, displaying all menu items (Pricing, Features, Changelog, Contacts) and the Get Started button in an easy-to-read vertical layout. This mobile-optimized approach makes it simple to explore IQ Rest's features and start creating your free restaurant website right from your phone. The theme and language selectors remain easily accessible in the header, while the hamburger menu keeps the interface clean and uncluttered.",
          "section2Title": "Enhanced Get Started Page for Free Restaurant Website Creation",
          "section2Text": "We've refined the signup page to make creating a free restaurant website even more intuitive. The improvements include better spacing on mobile devices, centered value proposition cards that clearly explain benefits, and optimized form layouts that work perfectly on small screens. The restaurant counter showing how many businesses already use IQ Rest now displays full-width on mobile, providing strong social proof that encourages new restaurant owners to start their free website. Every element has been carefully tested to ensure that creating your restaurant website is smooth and fast, whether you're on a desktop computer or your smartphone.",
          "image2Alt": "Optimized signup flow for free restaurant website creation",
          "image2Caption": "Streamlined signup process optimized for mobile devices",
          "section3Title": "Three-Step Process Optimized for All Devices",
          "section3Text": "The visual process indicator showing the three simple steps to create your free restaurant website (Sign up with your email, Add your menu items, Get your QR code & start) now adapts beautifully to different screen sizes. On mobile and tablets, the steps display vertically with clear spacing, making it easy to understand the simple process. On larger screens, they show horizontally with arrows. This adaptive design ensures that everyone, regardless of their device, can clearly see how quick and easy it is to create a professional restaurant website for free with IQ Rest.",
          "benefitsTitle": "Key Improvements for Creating Free Restaurant Websites",
          "benefit1": "Mobile-optimized hamburger menu navigation for easy access on smartphones",
          "benefit2": "Enhanced signup page with better mobile spacing and centered layouts",
          "benefit3": "Full-width restaurant counter on mobile providing strong social proof",
          "benefit4": "Adaptive three-step process indicator that works on all screen sizes",
          "benefit5": "Streamlined input forms optimized for mobile touch interaction",
          "benefit6": "Fixed logout redirect issue ensuring proper navigation across all pages",
          "conclusionTitle": "Free Restaurant Website Creation Made Simple",
          "conclusionText": "These improvements reinforce our commitment to making free restaurant website creation accessible to everyone. Whether you're a small cafe owner checking out IQ Rest on your phone during a break, or a restaurant manager planning your digital strategy on a tablet, the experience is now seamless and professional. You can create a complete restaurant website with QR menu, absolutely free, in just a few minutes from any device. No credit card required, no technical skills needed - just your menu and a few minutes of time to build your professional online presence.",
          "ctaText": "Ready to create your free restaurant website?",
          "ctaButton": "Get Started Free"
        }
      },
      "auth": {
        "title": "New User Authentication Interface",
        "description": "We've launched a simple and secure email-based authentication system that lets you create your restaurant website and QR menu in minutes.",
        "meta": {
          "title": "User Authentication Interface - IQ Rest Changelog",
          "description": "IQ Rest introduces a new passwordless authentication system for creating your restaurant website and digital QR menu quickly and securely"
        },
        "content": {
          "intro": "We are excited to announce the launch of our new user authentication interface for IQ Rest. This update represents a significant step forward in making it easier than ever to create your restaurant website with a professional QR menu. Our goal has always been to help restaurant and cafe owners build their digital presence in minutes, not hours, and this new authentication system is designed with that mission in mind.",
          "image1Alt": "Email input step of IQ Rest authentication",
          "image1Caption": "Simple email-based authentication - no passwords to remember",
          "section1Title": "Passwordless Authentication for Restaurant Owners",
          "section1Text": "Understanding that restaurant owners are busy people, we've implemented a passwordless authentication system that requires only your email address. When you want to create your restaurant website or update your digital QR menu, simply enter your email and receive a secure 4-digit verification code. This approach eliminates the frustration of forgotten passwords while maintaining the highest security standards for your restaurant's data. The entire process takes less than 30 seconds, allowing you to focus on what matters most - running your restaurant and serving your customers.",
          "section2Title": "Streamlined QR Menu Creation Process",
          "section2Text": "With our new authentication system, getting started with your digital QR menu has never been easier. Once authenticated, you'll have immediate access to our intuitive menu builder where you can add your dishes, set prices, upload photos, and organize categories. The QR menu you create will be accessible to your customers instantly - they simply scan the code and view your beautifully designed digital menu on their smartphone. No app downloads required for your customers, and no technical knowledge required from you. This is exactly what modern restaurants and cafes need to compete in today's digital-first world.",
          "image2Alt": "OTP verification step of IQ Rest authentication",
          "image2Caption": "Secure 4-digit code verification sent directly to your email",
          "section3Title": "Built for Speed and Security",
          "section3Text": "Security was our top priority when designing this authentication system. Each verification code expires after 10 minutes and can only be used once, protecting your restaurant website and menu data from unauthorized access. At the same time, we've optimized every step of the process for speed. From entering your email to accessing your dashboard, the entire authentication flow completes in under a minute. This means you can make quick updates to your QR menu during service, add daily specials, or adjust prices - all without any delays.",
          "benefitsTitle": "Key Benefits for Your Restaurant",
          "benefit1": "Create your restaurant website with QR menu in minutes - no technical skills required",
          "benefit2": "No passwords to remember - secure email-based verification keeps your account safe",
          "benefit3": "Instant access to your digital menu builder from any device",
          "benefit4": "Quick updates to your QR menu even during busy service hours",
          "conclusionTitle": "Start Building Your Digital Menu Today",
          "conclusionText": "This new authentication interface is just the beginning of our commitment to making digital QR menus accessible to every restaurant and cafe. Whether you're a small coffee shop or a growing restaurant chain, IQ Rest provides the tools you need to create a professional online presence. Your customers expect to find your menu online, and with our solution, you can exceed those expectations with a beautifully designed, always up-to-date digital QR menu that works perfectly on any smartphone.",
          "ctaText": "Ready to create your restaurant website with QR menu?",
          "ctaButton": "Get Started Free"
        }
      },
      "subscription-plans-qr-menu-restaurant-website": {
        "title": "Subscription Plans for QR Menu and Restaurant Website Creation",
        "description": "Introducing flexible subscription plans for creating your restaurant website and QR menu. Choose from Free, Growth, and Pro plans with monthly or yearly billing options.",
        "meta": {
          "title": "Subscription Plans for QR Menu and Restaurant Website | IQ Rest",
          "description": "Choose the perfect subscription plan for your restaurant website and QR menu creation. Free, Growth, and Pro plans with flexible monthly and yearly billing. Start free today."
        },
        "content": {
          "intro": "We're excited to announce the launch of our new subscription system for QR menu and restaurant website creation. IQ Rest now offers flexible plans that grow with your business - from a completely free tier for small cafes to professional plans for established restaurants. Whether you're just starting out or managing multiple locations, our subscription plans provide the features you need to create and maintain a professional restaurant website with QR menu capabilities.",
          "image1Alt": "Subscription plans for QR menu and restaurant website creation",
          "image1Caption": "Choose the perfect plan for your restaurant website and QR menu needs",
          "section1Title": "Flexible Plans for Every Restaurant Size",
          "section1Text": "Our subscription system for QR menu and restaurant website creation offers three tiers designed to match your needs. The Free plan lets you get started with up to 15 menu items - perfect for small cafes or trying out the platform. The Growth plan at €4/month (or €3/month billed yearly) expands your capacity to 100 items with 3 languages and 2,000 monthly scans. For growing restaurants, our Pro plan at €7/month (or €6/month yearly) offers unlimited items, languages, and scans - everything you need for professional restaurant website and QR menu management.",
          "section2Title": "Simple Billing Dashboard",
          "section2Text": "Managing your subscription for QR menu and restaurant website services is now easier than ever. Our new billing dashboard displays all available plans in a clean, simple interface. You can see your current plan at a glance, compare features, and upgrade or downgrade with a single click. The streamlined design shows each plan with its monthly price, making it easy to choose the right option for your restaurant website and QR menu needs. Secure payments are processed through Stripe, the industry standard for online transactions.",
          "section3Title": "Save 25% with Yearly Billing",
          "section3Text": "Restaurant owners who commit to yearly billing for their QR menu and website subscription save 25% compared to monthly payments. The Growth plan drops from €4 to €3 per month, while the Pro plan goes from €7 to €6 per month when billed annually. This significant savings helps restaurants invest more in their core business while maintaining a professional digital presence. Switch between monthly and yearly billing anytime through your dashboard.",
          "benefitsTitle": "Benefits of Our Subscription Plans",
          "benefit1": "Free plan available forever - no credit card required to start",
          "benefit2": "Flexible monthly or yearly billing with 25% savings on annual plans",
          "benefit3": "Instant plan upgrades - new features activate immediately",
          "benefit4": "Secure Stripe payment processing for all transactions",
          "benefit5": "Easy plan management through simple billing dashboard",
          "benefit6": "Downgrade anytime - no long-term contracts required",
          "conclusionTitle": "Start Creating Your Restaurant Website Today",
          "conclusionText": "With our new subscription plans, creating a professional QR menu and restaurant website has never been more accessible. Start with our Free plan to experience the platform, then upgrade as your restaurant grows. Our flexible billing options, transparent pricing, and instant activation mean you can have your digital menu up and running in minutes. Join thousands of restaurants already using IQ Rest to connect with their customers through modern, mobile-friendly QR menus.",
          "ctaText": "Ready to choose your plan for QR menu and restaurant website?",
          "ctaButton": "View Pricing Plans"
        }
      }
    }
  },
